<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1629420214"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:40.097"><div begin="7.889" end="29.945" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="7.889" end="11.443" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.889" end="9.790">总算有了</span><span begin="9.790" end="10.489">结</span><span begin="10.489" end="11.443">论</span></p><p begin="14.029" end="17.707" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.029" end="14.868">过程</span><span begin="14.868" end="15.406">是</span><span begin="15.714" end="16.706">和平</span><span begin="16.706" end="17.707">的</span></p><p begin="20.156" end="25.917" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.156" end="21.183">一起</span><span begin="21.183" end="21.720">走</span><span begin="21.720" end="22.306">着</span> <span begin="22.306" end="22.853">以为</span><span begin="22.853" end="23.694">就是</span><span begin="23.694" end="24.376">永</span><span begin="24.376" end="25.917">恒</span></p><p begin="26.401" end="29.945" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.401" end="27.438">这天</span><span begin="27.438" end="27.954">还</span><span begin="27.954" end="28.750">是</span><span begin="28.750" end="29.073">来</span><span begin="29.073" end="29.945">了</span></p></div><div begin="34.424" end="47.405" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="34.424" end="39.432" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.424" end="35.056">我</span><span begin="35.056" end="35.840">不</span><span begin="35.840" end="36.561">是</span><span begin="36.561" end="37.397">无</span><span begin="37.397" end="38.000">辜</span><span begin="38.000" end="39.432">的</span></p><p begin="39.505" end="47.405" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.505" end="40.913">你只是</span><span begin="40.913" end="42.279">明明</span><span begin="42.279" end="43.556">确确</span><span begin="43.556" end="44.289">地</span><span begin="44.289" end="44.716">不</span><span begin="44.716" end="45.323">爱</span><span begin="45.323" end="45.911">我</span><span begin="45.911" end="47.405">了</span>